  <conditions attached="1">
   <condition type="1">
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Before the initial Disbursement of Program Funding for any property valuation campaigns funded under the Increased Land Productivity Project, the Government must adopt reforms and gazette any necessary implementing regulations permitting flexibility in the property valuation, to enable the use of automated valuation methods and computer assisted mass appraisal approaches to achieve sustainable efficiencies and equity from employing these methods.</narrative>
